    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1632\">Level 6 — <strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1632\">Lifetithe</strong></h2><p data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1667\">You convert flesh into certainty.</p><h3 data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1687\">How This Works</h3><p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1733\">As part of an attack or Aura effect, you may:</p><ul data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1917\"><li data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1773\"><p data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1773\">Take <strong data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1773\">self-damage equal to your tier</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1917\"><p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1791\">Choose <strong data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1790\">one</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1917\"><li data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1835\"><p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1835\">Add <strong data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1811\">+1 Burn</strong> without using an action</p></li><li data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1861\"><p data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1861\">Reroll one damage die</p></li><li data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1917\"><p data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1917\">Reclaim a previously expended Aura effect this turn</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1967\">This damage <strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1966\">cannot be reduced or redirected</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1997\">The blade accepts sacrifice.</p>",
